# Atlas Directory Mappings (Example)
# Copy to atlas-mappings.conf and customize
# Maps project directory names to Atlas directory names
# Format: project_directory_name=atlas_directory_name
#
# This allows you to map complex project directory structures
# to simple Atlas project names for organization.
#
# Examples:
# my-website-v2=my-website
# client-project-abc=client-project
# legacy-system=legacy

# Add your mappings below:
# project-directory=atlas-name